  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Stilte in de klas (2022), published by Leuven University Press, has no recorded citations yet, but it has been downloaded 2,627 times. Beyond that, it is used in teaching.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Stilte in de klas by Pieter Verstraete was published by Leuven University Press in 2022. Conceptually, the work connects to Theology, Art and Philosophy.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">In teaching, it is discussed in 1 recorded lecture. It has been downloaded 2,627 times via OAPEN. Its subject matter aligns with Quality Education among the Sustainable Development Goals. The work was funded by KU Leuven.</p>",
